## Final section: Documentation reconciliation

> **Triggered by:** `implement` gate approved, user confirms happy.
> **Goal:** Update all CONTEXT.md files in `manifest.context_targets` to reflect this change.

- [ ] Run `context-verify.mjs` — baseline drift report
- [ ] Update root `CONTEXT.md`: {{what changes}}
- [ ] Update `{{component}}/CONTEXT.md`: {{what changes}}
- [ ] Re-stamp provenance on all updated CONTEXT.md files (`validated-at: <HEAD sha>`)
- [ ] Verifier subagent: confirm CONTEXT claims match implemented code
- [ ] Present reconciliation summary to user
- [ ] User approves → docs gate → approved
- [ ] Run `change-archive.mjs` → zip to `.changes/archive/{{id}}.zip`
